{"id":191263318282728,"type":"genre","name":"Techno holandés","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"img":null},"own_scenes":[{"id":801,"name":"Techno holandés","book":{"id":10,"slug":"loops-timeline","title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/","families":{"vanguardia":{"name":"Vanguardia y experimental","color":"#8b7cf6"},"ambient":{"name":"Ambient y escucha","color":"#38bdf8"},"rock":{"name":"Rock, synth-pop y canción","color":"#f472b6"},"industrial":{"name":"Industrial y ruido","color":"#94a3b8"},"jamaica":{"name":"Jamaica y sound system","color":"#facc15"},"disco":{"name":"Disco y house","color":"#fb923c"},"techno":{"name":"Techno y derivados","color":"#22d3ee"},"rave":{"name":"Rave y continuum hardcore","color":"#4ade80"},"hiphop":{"name":"Hip hop, breaks y ritmo lento","color":"#f87171"},"global":{"name":"Gueto global y periferias","color":"#a3e635"}}},"family":"Techno y derivados","color":"#22d3ee","start":1989,"end":2002,"place":"Eindhoven / La Haya","desc":"Holanda se inspira en Chicago y Detroit y cada ciudad tiene su variedad. Djax Up-Beats (Saskia Slegers, Eindhoven) se convierte en la reserva underground y rescata el sonido Chicago (Armando, Mike Dearborn, Paul Johnson). Stefan Robbers, Steve Rachmad y Orlando Voorn moldean un techno elegante de raíz detroitiana; Speedy J encuentra hogar en +8 y Warp; La Haya tiene a Unit Moebius y el sello Bunker.","aka":[],"notes":[],"influences":[{"name":"Detroit techno","id":86160731961488,"type":"genre"},{"name":"House","id":140333798282585,"type":"genre"}],"refs":[{"ch":10,"q":"cada ciudad holandesa ha tenido su variedad de techno particular","para":"Si Bélgica tomó la inspiración de modelos propios y se nutrió de talento extranjero, Holanda hizo exactamente lo contrario. La escena holandesa, a diferencia de sus vecinos, se inspiró en los modelos americanos clásicos —Chicago, Detroit— y cristalizó en un hervidero de variantes estilísticas muy localizadas geográficamente, hasta el punto de que se puede afirmar que cada ciudad holandesa ha tenido su variedad de techno particular.","page":290,"pdf":189,"chapter":"Cap. 10: El shock del futuro: techno, Detroit y más allá (1982-1993)"}],"artists":[{"id":144798203423521,"type":"artist","name":"Varios","rating":null},{"id":112545888818525,"type":"artist","name":"Speedy J","rating":null},{"id":192909388792153,"type":"artist","name":"Unit Moebius","rating":null},{"id":51061828629441,"type":"artist","name":"Stefan Robbers","rating":null},{"id":233611541933750,"type":"artist","name":"Steve Rachmad","rating":null},{"id":79644981471274,"type":"artist","name":"Orlando Voorn","rating":null},{"id":106059025251680,"type":"artist","name":"Saskia Slegers (Miss Djax)","rating":null},{"id":116080262625959,"type":"artist","name":"Edge of Motion","rating":null}],"tracks":[{"id":163206611328620,"artist_id":112545888818525,"artist":"Speedy J","title":"Journey","year":1991,"kind":null,"ess":0,"yt":"NlawgDacJPQ","type":"work"},{"id":119579530216033,"artist_id":112545888818525,"artist":"Speedy J","title":"Pullover","year":1991,"kind":null,"ess":0,"yt":"CHsNQlboq-8","type":"work"},{"id":143926472840896,"artist_id":112545888818525,"artist":"Speedy J","title":"Something for Your Mind","year":1991,"kind":null,"ess":0,"yt":"O0fiGE8gM5Y","type":"work"},{"id":208403825679918,"artist_id":112545888818525,"artist":"Speedy J","title":"Analogical","year":1992,"kind":null,"ess":0,"yt":"YnnZ3X6qXc8","type":"work"},{"id":205110572026092,"artist_id":112545888818525,"artist":"Speedy J","title":"Ginger","year":1993,"kind":null,"ess":0,"yt":"QaDkoE4zd3o","type":"album"},{"id":51274764675660,"artist_id":144798203423521,"artist":"Varios","title":"Mission Underground","year":1994,"kind":null,"ess":1,"yt":"5qrb7NkK66w","type":"work"}],"labels":[{"name":"Djax Up-Beats","id":76470570731066},{"name":"Eevolute Muzique","id":239101661545674},{"name":"100% Pure","id":108953